@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Feature 002 - Planned Architecture
actor Teacher
actor "Anonymous student browsers" as Students
component "React teacher UI\naccount generation + history + table" as TeacherUI
component "React student UI\nwaiting / active / ended" as StudentUI
component "Express + Socket.IO\nteacher loopback listener" as TeacherAPI
component "Express + Socket.IO\nstudent listener" as StudentAPI
component "Verified account / owner guards\nrole projections + CSRF" as Guards
component "Serialized command service\nvalidate / transaction / commit / ack" as Commands
component "SQLite repositories\nstartup migrations + recovery" as Repos
component "Durable writeback worker\nowner credentials / precheck / verify" as Worker
component "Runtime-only OAuth vault\nverified sub, tokens, auth generation" as Vault
database "Local SQLite\nactivities / answers / receipts / outbox\nWAL + FULL / no raw tokens or cookies" as DB
cloud "Google OIDC / Drive / Sheets" as Google
Teacher --> TeacherUI
Students --> StudentUI
TeacherUI --> TeacherAPI
StudentUI --> StudentAPI
TeacherAPI --> Guards
StudentAPI --> Guards
Guards --> Commands
Commands --> Repos
Repos --> DB
Commands --> Worker : wake after end commit
Worker --> Repos : durable progress
Worker --> Vault : credentials by job owner
TeacherAPI --> Vault
Vault --> Google : OAuth / verified identity
TeacherAPI --> Google : list / first sheet preview
Worker --> Google : original sheetId / batch / readback
note bottom of Commands
One Node process, one ordered mutation entry.
No network inside DB transaction.
Commit before successful ack and broadcast.
end + results + job are atomic.
end note
@enduml
